6T16:08:09+01:00"}},"timing":{"peak":"Nov-Apr (dry); whale season Dec 15-Apr 15; Socorro liveaboard Nov-Jun; NYE + Spring Break premium","shoulder":"May and October (October carries Bisbee''s crowd)","green":"Jul-Sep hot/humid, Pacific hurricane/chubasco season Jun-Nov (peak Sep-Oct); Socorro closed","booking_lead":"Socorro liveaboards 6-12+ months ahead; Bisbee''s-week lodging + charters months ahead; NYE/Spring-Break villas + ultra suites months ahead","off_season_specials":"green-summer value (lowest rates, warm sea, dorado/tuna fishing) to price-sensitive couples/families + mandatory hurricane trip insurance","event_peaks":["Bisbee''s Black & Blue Oct 19-24 2026 ($11.5M+ purse)","Christmas/NYE premium","US Spring Break (Mar)","whale season Dec 15-Apr 15"],"campaign_start":"Socorro campaign 9-12 months out; whale-season push Aug-Oct; Bisbee''s/sportfishing micro-campaign spring-summer; green-value push May-Jun"},"jewels":[{"name":"Socorro/Revillagigedo giant-manta liveaboard","si_tag":"Dive Liveaboards","status":"live","hook":"giant Pacific mantas approach + stay; up to 10 shark species, whale sharks, humpbacks","bookable_category":"liveaboard","tier":"premier","source":"https://nautilusliveaboards.com/socorro/","si":"liveaboard","blurb":"giant Pacific mantas approach + stay; up to 10 shark species, whale sharks, humpbacks","commission":"Aggressor/liveaboard reseller = Commissioned Agent on application (TCI moat)"},{"name":"Roca Partida (Socorro site)","si_tag":"Dive Liveaboards","status":"live","hook":"isolated open-ocean pinnacle, silvertips + Galapagos sharks in the current","bookable_category":"liveaboard itinerary","tier":"premier","source":"https://www.bluewaterdivetravel.com/destination/socorro-island-diving","timing":"Nov-Apr","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","si":"liveaboard","blurb":"isolated open-ocean pinnacle, silvertips + Galapagos sharks in the current","when":"Nov-Apr","commission":"liveaboard reseller = Commissioned Agent on application"},{"name":"Gray + humpback whale-watching","si_tag":"Global Expedition Adventures","status":"live","hook":"humpback breaching/mating + gray whale calves","bookable_category":"whale-watch tour","tier":"essential","source":"https://www.visitloscabos.travel/blog/post/whale-watching-in-los-cabos-2025-the-ultimate-guide-to-an-unforgettable-season/","si":"expedition","blurb":"humpback breaching/mating + gray whale calves","commission":"DMC + Viator/GYG affiliate"},{"name":"Bisbee''s Black & Blue marlin sportfishing","si_tag":"Ocean Adventures","status":"future","hook":"world''s richest billfish tournament; Marlin Capital of the World","bookable_category":"sportfishing charter","tier":"comfort","source":"https://bisbees.com/tournaments/bisbees-black-blue","timing":"Nov-Apr","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","si":"ocean","blurb":"world''s richest billfish tournament; Marlin Capital of the World","when":"Nov-Apr","commission":"charter/DMC commission on application"},{"name":"Land''s End / El Arco + Pelican Rock snorkel","si_tag":"Ocean Adventures","status":"future","hook":"iconic granite arch + easy snorkel at the peninsula tip","bookable_category":"boat/snorkel tour","tier":"essential","source":"https://www.cabovillas.com/yacht-tours","timing":"Nov-Apr","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","si":"ocean","blurb":"iconic granite arch + easy snorkel at the peninsula tip","when":"Nov-Apr","commission":"Viator/GYG affiliate + DMC"},{"name":"Superyacht + private-jet charter","si_tag":"Luxury","status":"future","hook":"jet-to-yacht for the ultra client","bookable_category":"charter","tier":"ultra","source":"https://www.cabovillas.com/jet-charters","timing":"Nov-Apr","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","si":"Luxury","blurb":"jet-to-yacht for the ultra client","when":"Nov-Apr","commission":"charter/DMC commission on application"}],"faq":[{"q":"When can I dive Socorro from Cabo, and what will I see?","a":"Socorro runs by liveaboard only, roughly November–June, on a ~24-hour crossing from Cabo — there is no day-boat option. The draw is giant Pacific mantas that approach and stay through whole dives, up to 10 shark species, dolphins, whale sharks (Nov–Dec) and humpbacks (Jan–Mar). Book berths 6–12+ months out.","source":"bluewaterdivetravel.com, 2026-07-04","si_tag":"liveaboard"},{"q":"When is whale season in Cabo?","a":"December 15 to April 15, with peak sightings January–March. Humpbacks breach and mate while gray whales pass with newborn calves, all on boat-based tours out of Cabo.","source":"visitloscabos.travel, 2026-07-04","si_tag":"expedition"},{"q":"When is Bisbee''s, and is Cabo really the \"Marlin Capital\"?","a":"Bisbee''s Black & Blue runs the third week of October — Oct 19–24 in 2026 — with a purse topping $11.5 million, and Cabo backs the \"Marlin Capital\" tag with year-round blue and black marlin, dorado and tuna. Tournament-week lodging and charters sell out months ahead.","source":"bisbees.com, 2026-07-04","si_tag":"ocean"},{"q":"Is Cabo good for a honeymoon, and where''s the top end?","a":"Yes — it is one of North America''s densest ultra clusters, with multiple Forbes Five-Star flags. The honeymoon flagships are Las Ventanas al Paraíso (Rosewood) and One&Only Palmilla; Waldorf Astoria Pedregal, Montage and Chileno Bay sit alongside on the corridor''s rare swimmable coves.","source":"forbes.com, 2026-07-04","si_tag":"romance"},{"q":"Is diving Socorro dangerous?","a":"It is advanced, remote diving — manageable with discipline. Socorro has strong currents, deep pelagic sites and no chamber at the archipelago; a hit means a ~24-hour steam back to Cabo''s chamber. Dive within your certification, follow the boat''s conservative plan, carry DAN evacuation cover, and wait 18–24 h before flying home.","source":"bluewaterdivetravel.com / dan.org, 2026-07-04","si_tag":"safety"}],"seo":{"meta_title":"Cabo San Lucas: Socorro Liveaboards, Whales & Ultra Cabo","meta_description":"Cabo San Lucas is the port where Socorro''s giant-manta liveaboards begin - plus whale season, Bisbee''s marlin, and one of North America''s densest ultra-luxury clusters.","slug":"cabo-san-lucas-mexico","primary_keyword":"Cabo San Lucas Socorro liveaboard","long_tail":["Socorro Revillagigedo liveaboard from Cabo","Cabo whale watching season","Bisbee''s Black and Blue 2026 dates","Cabo San Lucas luxury resorts Virtuoso","giant manta ray diving Mexico"],"search_language":["en","es-MX"],"local_keywords":["buceo liveaboard Socorro desde Cabo San Lucas","avistamiento de ballenas Los Cabos","torneo de marlin Bisbee''s Black and Blue","mantarraya gigante Revillagigedo","villas de lujo en Cabo San Lucas","resorts cinco estrellas Los Cabos"],"hreflang":["en","es-MX"],"jsonld_type":"TouristDestination","content_freshness":"2026-07-04"},"booking":null,"si_checklist_25":null,"sis_present":[{"si":"liveaboard","status":"live","note":"Socorro/Revillagigedo liveaboards depart Cabo San Lucas, ~24h crossing, Nov-Jun season"},{"si":"expedition","status":"live","note":"gray + humpback whale-watching Dec 15-Apr 15"},{"si":"ocean","status":"future"},{"si":"ultra","status":"future"}],"ultra":[{"name":"Waldorf Astoria Los Cabos Pedregal","why_ultra":"top overall Los Cabos rec; cliffside Pedregal, private tunnel, plunge-pool suites","earning":"Virtuoso/Hilton Impresario preferred + commission on application","virtuoso_value_add":"upgrade, breakfast, resort credit, early check-in/late check-out (verify)","mor":"agent-of-record","price_tier":"ultra"},{"name":"One&Only Palmilla","why_ultra":"timeless glamour, personalized service, family + honeymoon icon","earning":"Virtuoso preferred + commission on application","virtuoso_value_add":"upgrade, breakfast, credit, VIP welcome (verify)","mor":"agent-of-record","price_tier":"ultra"},{"name":"Las Ventanas al Paraiso, A Rosewood Resort","why_ultra":"the Cabo honeymoon flagship, Rosewood service, artisan interiors","earning":"Rosewood Elite / Virtuoso preferred + commission on application","virtuoso_value_add":"upgrade, breakfast, spa/resort credit (verify)","mor":"agent-of-record","price_tier":"ultra"},{"name":"Montage Los Cabos","why_ultra":"rated best high-end hotel in Los Cabos, rare swimmable cove","earning":"Montage / Virtuoso preferred + commission on application","virtuoso_value_add":"upgrade, breakfast, credit (verify)","mor":"agent-of-record","price_tier":"ultra"},{"name":"Chileno Bay Resort & Residences (Auberge)","why_ultra":"99-key Auberge on a protected swimmable cove","earning":"Auberge / Virtuoso preferred + commission on application","virtuoso_value_add":"upgrade, breakfast, credit (verify)","mor":"agent-of-record","price_tier":"ultra"},{"name":"Esperanza (Auberge)","why_ultra":"Punta Ballena oceanfront, timeless elegance + culinary","earning":"Auberge / Virtuoso preferred + commission on application","virtuoso_value_add":"upgrade, breakfast, credit (verify)","mor":"agent-of-record","price_tier":"ultra"},{"name":"Four Seasons Cabo del Sol","why_ultra":"Four Seasons service, foodie-led resort","earning":"FSPP / Virtuoso preferred + commission on application","virtuoso_value_add":"upgrade, breakfast, credit (verify)","mor":"agent-of-record","price_tier":"ultra"},{"name":"Nobu Hotel Los Cabos","why_ultra":"Nobu design-luxury + signature restaurant, celebrity draw","earning":"preferred-partner + commission on application","virtuoso_value_add":"verify current program","mor":"agent-of-record","price_tier":"ultra"},{"name":"Fully-staffed ultra villa buyout + superyacht/jet charter","why_ultra":"private-estate + LUX cross-cut (NetJets/VistaJet jet-to-yacht)","earning":"villa-agency/charter commission on application (no net-rate resale)","virtuoso_value_add":"attach Virtuoso hotel pre/post-stay","mor":"clean agent-side; red-flag villa-inventory mark-up","price_tier":"ultra"}],"source_verified":"2