e 5,200 m gut-check","when":"May–August","commission":"DMC / activity affiliate"},{"name":"Humantay Lake (~4,200 m)","si_tag":"expedition","tier":"comfort","source":"https://www.salkantaytrekking.com/traditional/cusco/humantay-lake-full-day/","hook":"a turquoise glacial lake under Salkantay''s snows; a demanding half-day climb from Soraypampa","si":"expedition","blurb":"a turquoise glacial lake under Salkantay''s snows; a demanding half-day climb from Soraypampa","commission":"DMC / activity affiliate"},{"name":"Salkantay Pass trek (~4,650 m)","si_tag":"expedition","tier":"premier","source":"https://www.salkantaytrekking.com/trekking-in-peru/cusco/salkantay-rainbow-mountain-trek-7d/","timing":"May–August","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","hook":"the high alternative to the Inca Trail, often chained to Machu Picchu; multi-day, guided","si":"expedition","blurb":"the high alternative to the Inca Trail, often chained to Machu Picchu; multi-day, guided","when":"May–August","commission":"DMC multi-day trek"},{"name":"San Blas artisan barrio, Cusco","si_tag":"culture","tier":"essential","source":"https://www.salkantaytrekking.com/blog/maras-and-moray-sacred-valley-guide/","timing":"May–August","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","hook":"the steep bohemian quarter of workshops, silversmiths and cafés above the Plaza. Free to wander; monetizes through walking tours + boutique retail","si":"culture","blurb":"the steep bohemian quarter of workshops, silversmiths and cafés above the Plaza. Free to wander; monetizes through walking tours + boutique retail","when":"May–August","commission":"DMC city tour / affiliate"},{"name":"Sacsayhuamán + Q''enqo","si_tag":"culture","tier":"comfort","source":"https://turismoliberty.pe/en/cusco-tourist-ticket-2026/","timing":"May–August","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","hook":"the cyclopean fortress-temple above Cusco and the nearby carved ritual site; both on the Boleto Turístico Circuit I","si":"culture","blurb":"the cyclopean fortress-temple above Cusco and the nearby carved ritual site; both on the Boleto Turístico Circuit I","when":"May–August","commission":"DMC guided; Boleto Turístico entry"},{"name":"Pisac market + ruins","si_tag":"culture","tier":"comfort","source":"https://www.salkantaytrekking.com/blog/maras-and-moray-sacred-valley-guide/","timing":"year-round","timing_type":"ALWAYS-ON","hook":"the classic Andean textile/craft market beneath dramatic terraced ruins and an ancient cliff cemetery","si":"culture","blurb":"the classic Andean textile/craft market beneath dramatic terraced ruins and an ancient cliff cemetery","when":"year-round","commission":"DMC circuit; Boleto Turístico III"},{"name":"Ollantaytambo living-Inca town","si_tag":"culture","tier":"comfort","source":"https://www.machupicchureservations.org/tour/sacred-valley-tour-full-day-2/","timing":"May–August","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","hook":"one of the last inhabited Inca settlements, streets still fed by working 500-year-old canals","si":"culture","blurb":"one of the last inhabited Inca settlements, streets still fed by working 500-year-old canals","when":"May–August","commission":"DMC circuit + rail; Boleto Turístico III"},{"name":"Maras salt pans + Moray terraces","si_tag":"culture","tier":"comfort","source":"https://www.salkantaytrekking.com/blog/maras-and-moray-sacred-valley-guide/","timing":"May–August","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","hook":"4,500+ hand-worked salt pools fed by a pre-Inca spring, and the Inca''s circular \"agricultural laboratory\" of microclimate terraces. Iconic photography, deep story","si":"culture","blurb":"4,500+ hand-worked salt pools fed by a pre-Inca spring, and the Inca''s circular \"agricultural laboratory\" of microclimate terraces. Iconic photography, deep story","when":"May–August","commission":"DMC circuit; Boleto Turístico III (Moray)"},{"name":"Chinchero weaving village","si_tag":"culture","tier":"essential","source":"https://www.salkantaytrekking.com/blog/maras-and-moray-sacred-valley-guide/","timing":"May–August","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","hook":"the \"birthplace of the rainbow,\" high-plateau town with a Textile Interpretation Center where women demonstrate natural-dye alpaca weaving","si":"culture","blurb":"the \"birthplace of the rainbow,\" high-plateau town with a Textile Interpretation Center where women demonstrate natural-dye alpaca weaving","when":"May–August","commission":"DMC circuit + artisan retail; Boleto Turístico III"},{"name":"Cusco Cathedral + Qorikancha","si_tag":"culture","tier":"comfort","source":"https://turismoliberty.pe/en/cusco-tourist-ticket-2026/","timing":"year-round","timing_type":"ALWAYS-ON","hook":"the colonial cathedral on the Plaza de Armas and the Inca Temple of the Sun whose gold-clad walls the Spanish built Santo Domingo atop","si":"culture","blurb":"the colonial cathedral on the Plaza de Armas and the Inca Temple of the Sun whose gold-clad walls the Spanish built Santo Domingo atop","when":"year-round","commission":"DMC city tour; separate admissions"},{"name":"San Pedro Market, Cusco","si_tag":"culture","tier":"essential","source":"https://www.salkantaytrekking.com/blog/maras-and-moray-sacred-valley-guide/","timing":"May–August","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","hook":"the working city market: produce, cheeses, juices, textiles, street food; the sensory anchor of a food-focused day","si":"culture","blurb":"the working city market: produce, cheeses, juices, textiles, street food; the sensory anchor of a food-focused day","when":"May–August","commission":"DMC food/market tour"},{"name":"Pisco + Andean cuisine chef''s-table","si_tag":"RHN / Culinary","tier":"premier","source":"https://luxurylatinamerica.com/blog/2024/12/10/stay-in-the-sacred-valley/","timing":"May–August","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","hook":"the high-Andes ingredient story at chef''s-table and tasting-menu level, paired with pisco. Sacred Valley luxe lodges and Cusco''s fine-dining scene carry this","si":"RHN / Culinary","blurb":"the high-Andes ingredient story at chef''s-table and tasting-menu level, paired with pisco. Sacred Valley luxe lodges and Cusco''s fine-dining scene carry this","when":"May–August","commission":"DMC private dining / lodge F&B"}],"faq":[{"q":"Do you need to acclimatize before Rainbow Mountain?","a":"Yes — acclimatize 1–2 days minimum in Cusco or the valley before any high hike, and never climb Rainbow Mountain on your first or second day. It matters because more than a third of travelers to Cusco feel altitude sickness, the summit sits at ~5,200 m (roughly 11% effective oxygen), and the core risk is acute mountain sickness, not terrain. Go guided — reputable operators carry oxygen, manage pace and pull travelers who deteriorate.","source":"turismoliberty.pe, Accessed 2026-07-07","si_tag":"expedition"},{"q":"What does the Cusco Tourist Ticket cover?","a":"The integral Boleto Turístico costs S/130 (~$35), is valid 10 days across 16 sites, and is cash-only in soles with no online option. Note what it does not cover: Machu Picchu, Qorikancha, the Cathedral, Rainbow Mountain and Humantay all require separate admission, so budget those as pass-through costs on top.","source":"turismoliberty.pe, Accessed 2026-07-07","si_tag":"culture"},{"q":"Which are the best luxury lodges in the Sacred Valley and Cusco?","a":"The honeymoon spine runs from Cusco''s Belmond Palacio Nazarenas (55 oxygen-enriched all-suites) and Belmond Monasterio (a 16th-century monastery, 117 rooms) out to the valley''s explora Valle Sagrado, Sol y Luna (Relais & Châteaux) and Tambo del Inka — the Luxury Collection resort with its own private rail station to Machu Picchu.","source":"belmond.com, Accessed 2026-07-07","si_tag":"romance"},{"q":"When do you need to book for Inti Raymi and peak season?","a":"Book 3–4 months out — by late March, ideally February — for June–August and Inti Raymi trips, because capacity, not price, is what runs out. Inti Raymi (the Festival of the Sun) falls on June 24 and sells the city out months ahead, and Machu Picchu tickets, trains and hotels are capacity-capped in peak season.","source":"perurail.com, Accessed 2026-07-07","si_tag":"expedition"},{"q":"What''s the real risk in Cusco — is it altitude?","a":"Yes — altitude outranks crime by a wide margin. Cusco sits at ~3,400 m and Rainbow Mountain at ~5,200 m, and more than a third of travelers feel altitude sickness (soroche), some moderate-to-severe. Acclimatize 1–2 days before any high hike, ascend gradually, hydrate, use coca, and discuss prophylactic acetazolamide (Diamox) with a physician; the emergency number is 105.","source":"turismoliberty.pe, Accessed 2026-07-07","si_tag":"safety"},{"q":"Is Rainbow Mountain dangerous?","a":"The danger is altitude, not the walk. At ~5,200 m the core risk is acute mountain sickness, so guided is strongly preferred — reputable operators carry oxygen, manage pace and pull travelers who deteriorate — and the non-negotiable rule is to acclimatize 1–2 days first. Travelers who want the color without the 5,200 m gut-check can take Palccoyo, the gentler-altitude \"rainbow\" alternative.","source":"altitude-peru.com, Accessed 2026-07-07","si_tag":"safety"}],"seo":{"meta_title":"Cusco & the Sacred Valley, Peru — Travel Guide, Treks, Luxury Lodges & Altitude Tips | TravelWell.World","jsonld_type":"TouristDestination","freshness":"2026-07-07","search_language":"es-PE","local_keywords":["qué hacer en Cusco","Valle Sagrado tour","Montaña de 7 Colores","boleto turístico Cusco 2026","mal de altura Cusco soroche","Laguna Humantay","Inti Raymi 24 de junio","Maras Moray salineras","Ollantaytambo qué ver"],"hreflang":["en","es-PE"],"primary_keyword":"Cusco & the Sacred Valley"},"booking":null,"si_checklist_25":null,"sis_present":[{"si":"culture","status":"live"}],"ultra":[{"name":"Belmond Palacio Nazarenas","location":"Cusco","earning":"Virtuoso preferred; agency AoR + VIP amenities","mor":"agency/hotel","tier":"$$$$"},{"name":"Belmond Monasterio","location":"Cusco","earning":"Virtuoso preferred; agency AoR","mor":"agency/hotel","tier":"$$$$"},{"name":"Belmond Río Sagrado","location":"Sacred Valley","earning":"Virtuoso/Belmond preferred; agency AoR","mor":"agency/hotel","tier":"$$$$"},{"name":"JW Marriott El Convento Cusco","location":"Cusco","earning":"Marriott Luxury/STARS; agency AoR + Bonvoy","mor":"agency/hotel","tier":"$$$$"},{"name":"Inkaterra La Casona","location":"Cusco","earning":"Relais & Châteaux/Virtuoso; agency AoR","mor":"agency/hotel","tier":"$$$$"},{"name":"explora Valle Sagrado","location":"Sacred Valley","earning":"Virtuoso; agency AoR","mor":"agency/hotel","tier":"$$$$"},{"name":"Sol y Luna","location":"Sacred Valley","earning":"Relais & Châteaux/Virtuoso; agency AoR","mor":"agency/hotel","tier":"$$$$"},{"name":"Tambo del Inka, a Luxury Collection Resort & Spa","location":"Sacred Valley (Urubamba)","earning":"Marriott Luxury/STARS; agency AoR + Bonvoy","mor":"agency/hotel","tier":"$$$$"}],"source_verified":null,"hero":{"query":"Cusco & the Sacred Valley, Peru, Peru"},"geo":{"lat":-13.5319,"lng":-71.9675}}'::jsonb, 32),
